cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
message: >-
  As a matter of scholarly practice, when using RustBEARS (the drop-in R
  package or native Python interface), please co-cite BOTH the foundational
  BioGeoBEARS publications by Nicholas J. Matzke (2013, 2014) listed under
  references AND this RustBEARS software release.
title: "RustBEARS: Uncertainty-Aware Likelihood Inference of Historical Biogeography"
version: "1.2.0.dev0"
license: "GPL-3.0-or-later"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Jhe1004/RustBEARS"
url: "https://github.com/Jhe1004/RustBEARS"
authors:
